# Local configuration and secrets — never commit these.
appsettings.*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12

# Python — the licence gate in .github/licence-gate/ is a script, not a package.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Helm — `helm dependency update` resolves deploy/helm/*/Chart.yaml's file://
# entries by PACKAGING the sibling chart into charts/ and writing a digest into
# Chart.lock. Neither is source: the tarball is a binary copy of a directory two
# levels up, and the lock pins nothing a remote repository could move, because
# nothing here comes from one.
#
# Chart.lock earns its place when a dependency is fetched over the network and
# a build has to be reproducible against a repository that changed. Committed
# here it would be a second copy of the version already in Chart.yaml, and one
# that goes stale on a bump — which is the drift CLAUDE.md's one rule exists to
# close. `helm dependency update` is the whole of the setup, and smoke.sh and
# the CI job both run it before anything else.
deploy/helm/*/charts/
deploy/helm/*/Chart.lock
